{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022202155048-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022214904\"/><p>今晚(22日)攪珠的今年第113期六合彩，攪珠結果為4、11、12、16、38、48，特別號碼5。頭獎無人中；二獎4注中，每注派彩364,530港元；三獎79注中，每注派49,210港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周六(24日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金達13,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:20.380471+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T12:21:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T14:17:50.647209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:57:49.714788+00:00","content_hash":"0918158a23271ae372551f105c2f0a4f549287accb59b721204b70caefe50bef","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}